========================================================================
O64 二期 07: O67 整合 — 9 費米子質量公式
========================================================================

=== [1] O67 質量公式 ===
  m = M0 × γ_n × F_proj
  M0 = 27.9009 MeV = 0.0279 GeV
  e: γ_1×3.6 = 0.51 MeV (PDG: 0.51, Δ=0.16%)
  mu: γ_7×15.5 = 105.80 MeV (PDG: 105.66, Δ=0.13%)
  tau: γ_20×37.0 = 1770.83 MeV (PDG: 1776.86, Δ=0.34%)

=== [2] SM 9 費米子質量 ===
  u   : 1.300e+00 MeV = 1.300000e-03 GeV
  d   : 2.700e+00 MeV = 2.700000e-03 GeV
  e   : 5.110e-01 MeV = 5.110000e-04 GeV
  c   : 6.200e+02 MeV = 6.200000e-01 GeV
  s   : 5.500e+01 MeV = 5.500000e-02 GeV
  mu  : 1.057e+02 MeV = 1.056600e-01 GeV
  t   : 1.730e+05 MeV = 1.730000e+02 GeV
  b   : 4.180e+03 MeV = 4.180000e+00 GeV
  tau : 1.777e+03 MeV = 1.776860e+00 GeV

=== [3] 同代共享 F_proj 假設 ===

  F_proj(gen1) = 3.6 (from e)
  F_proj(gen2) = 15.5 (from μ)
  F_proj(gen3) = 37.0 (from τ)

  Required γ_n = m / (M0 × F_proj):
    u: γ_n = 0.0129 (m=1.30e+00 MeV, F_proj=3.6)
      → closest γ_2 = 0.020357 (diff=0.0074)
    d: γ_n = 0.0269 (m=2.70e+00 MeV, F_proj=3.6)
      → closest γ_2 = 0.020357 (diff=0.0065)
    c: γ_n = 1.4336 (m=6.20e+02 MeV, F_proj=15.5)
      → closest γ_18 = 1.436535 (diff=0.0029)
    s: γ_n = 0.1272 (m=5.50e+01 MeV, F_proj=15.5)
      → closest γ_5 = 0.126101 (diff=0.0011)
    t: γ_n = 167.5815 (m=1.73e+05 MeV, F_proj=37.0)
      → closest γ_44 = 4.000000 (diff=163.5815)
    b: γ_n = 4.0491 (m=4.18e+03 MeV, F_proj=37.0)
      → closest γ_44 = 4.000000 (diff=0.0491)

=== [4] t quark 特殊問題 ===
  t quark: m = 173000 MeV
  F_proj(gen3) = 37
  Required γ_n = 167.58
  γ_n max = 4.00 (γ_44)
  Required γ_n exceeds γ_n max by 42×!
\n  Possible solutions:
  1. t quark has larger F_proj: F_proj = 1550
  2. t quark couples to φ-power: F_proj_eff = F_proj × φ^k
     φ^k with k=7.8 (k=8)
  3. t quark mass comes from a different mechanism (like ν's p6)

