  b   :  4129.33 MeV (SM:  4180.00 MeV, Δ=1.21%) using γ_44
  tau :  1770.83 MeV (SM:  1776.86 MeV, Δ=0.34%) using γ₂₀

=== [6] 結構 γ_n 候選（by 66 態群組）===
  Gen3 (C1, states 0-15): mean γ_avg ≈ 1.0-1.5
    Known: τ → γ₂₀ = 1.7154 (F_proj=37)
    Candidate: b → γ_16 = 1.1692 (F_proj=37)
      m_b = 1207.0 MeV (SM: 4180 MeV)
    Candidate: t → needs special F_proj or mechanism

  Gen2 (K-fermion, states 22-31): mean γ_avg ≈ 0.8-1.1
    Known: μ → γ₇ = 0.2446 (F_proj=15.5)
    Candidate: s → γ₆ = 0.1807 (F_proj=15.5)
      m_s = 78.2 MeV (SM: 55 MeV)
    Candidate: c → γ₁₃ = 0.8014 (F_proj=15.5)
      m_c = 346.6 MeV (SM: 620 MeV)

  Gen1 (C2, states 58-65): mean γ_avg ≈ 0.005-0.02
    Known: e → γ₁ = 0.0051 (F_proj=3.6)
    Candidate: d → γ₂ = 0.0204 (F_proj=3.6)
      m_d = 2.04 MeV (SM: 2.7 MeV)
    Candidate: u → γ₁ = 0.0051 (F_proj=3.6)
      m_u = 0.51 MeV (SM: 1.3 MeV)


